    \\& \Phi \text{ is a nilcharacter of frequency } 1;
    \\& \Vert\Phi\Vert_{Lip(X)}\leq 1;
    \\& \Bigl\vert\mathbb{E}_{\alpha\in R_{\tilde{N}}}\bold{1}_{P}(\alpha)\chi(\alpha)\Phi(g'(\beta+\alpha)\cdot e_{X})\Bigr\vert\geq\kappa_{2}
